                                "sense_id": "7e21ff5f-f501-3a8b-bec9-68f9d47077ad",
                                "text": "Man has many times suffered from his attempts at extermination, and in no way, perhaps, would he suffer more, than by utterly destroying the mischievous teredo, and its active little ally, the xylophagous linmeria."
                            }
